msgid "For Qiskit Functions authentication, job management, or IBM Quantum Platform access, see the [Qiskit Functions documentation](/guides/functions).\n"
msgstr "Para autenticação do Qiskit Functions, gerenciamento de jobs ou acesso à IBM Quantum Platform, consulte a [documentação do Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos passos {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Review the [`simulate_dynamics` API reference](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/references/fire-opal/fireopal/fireopal.simulate_dynamics) for the underlying model, simulation, observable, output, and validation definitions.\n"
"- Try the [Spin and charge dynamics in the Fermi-Hubbard model](/tutorials/fermi-hubbard-spin-charge-dynamics) tutorial.\n"
"- Read the [Fire Opal dynamics simulator overview](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/fire-opal/execute/run-algorithms/fire-opal-dynamics-simulator) for more detail about Trotterization, hardware-aware mapping, and Fire Opal error suppression.\n"
"- Modify the model parameters, initial state, time step, step count, and observables to study a different one-dimensional Fermi-Hubbard dynamics problem.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendações\">\n"
"- Revise a [referência da API `simulate_dynamics`](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/references/fire-opal/fireopal/fireopal.simulate_dynamics) para as definições subjacentes de modelo, simulação, observável, saída e validação.\n"
"- Experimente o tutorial [Dinâmica de spin e carga no modelo de Fermi-Hubbard](/tutorials/fermi-hubbard-spin-charge-dynamics).\n"
"- Leia a [visão geral do simulador de dinâmica do Fire Opal](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/fire-opal/execute/run-algorithms/fire-opal-dynamics-simulator) para mais detalhes sobre Trotterização, mapeamento ciente do hardware e supressão de erros do Fire Opal.\n"
"- Modifique os parâmetros do modelo, o estado inicial, o passo de tempo, o número de passos e os observáveis para estudar um problema diferente de dinâmica de Fermi-Hubbard unidimensional.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
